{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26767","headline":"街西居三首 一 · 姚合","name":"街西居三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"受得山野性，住城多事违。\n青山在宅南，回首东西稀。\n浅浅一井泉，数家同汲之。\n独我恶水浊，凿井庭之陲。\n自凿还自饮，亦爲衆所非。\n吁嗟世间事，洁身诚难爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26767.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26767","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}